 "右冠狀動脈供應右心室與左心室下壁；中段被血栓塞住時，會造成下壁心肌梗塞。心導管經手腕或鼠蹊部動脈進入，依序放入導引導管、導絲、吸栓導管、氣球與支架，恢復血流。動畫約 27 秒，可點下方步驟跳轉或重播。": "The right coronary artery supplies the right ventricle and the inferior wall of the left ventricle; a thrombus blocking the mid segment causes an inferior myocardial infarction. The catheter enters through the radial or femoral artery, and a guiding catheter, guidewire, aspiration catheter, balloon and stent are placed in turn to restore flow. The animation lasts about 27 seconds; click a step below to jump or replay.",
 "右冠狀動脈急性阻塞，如何打通血管": "How to reopen an acutely blocked right coronary artery",
