 "回拉完成。下方縱切圖標出最小管腔面積（MLA）與最小支架面積（MSA）的位置；點縱切圖可跳到任一位置並自動量測。支架擴張不足（MSA ÷ 參考管腔面積 < 80%）通常需以高壓非順應性氣球再擴張；鈣化弧＞180°、厚度＞0.5 mm 時要先處理鈣化。": "Pullback complete. The longitudinal view marks the minimal lumen area (MLA) and the minimal stent area (MSA); tap it to jump to any frame and measure automatically. Stent under-expansion (MSA ÷ reference lumen area < 80%) usually calls for post-dilation with a high-pressure non-compliant balloon; calcium with an arc > 180° and thickness > 0.5 mm should be modified first.",
 "大 v 波不是 MR 專有：左心房順應性差、VSD、MS、心衰竭也會出現；急性重度 MR 的 v 波最明顯，慢性 MR 合併大而順應的左心房反而可能不明顯。": "A large v wave is not specific to MR: a stiff left atrium, VSD, MS and heart failure can also cause it. It is most striking in acute severe MR, and may be modest in chronic MR with a large, compliant left atrium.",
 "導引導管": "Guiding catheter",
