 "左心室尚未擴大，前向輸出量大減：主動脈壓偏低、脈壓窄，血壓不穩（休克傾向），與慢性代償期不同。": "The left ventricle is not yet dilated and forward output falls sharply: aortic pressure is low with a narrow pulse pressure and the patient is unstable (tends toward shock), unlike the compensated chronic state.",
 "左心室沒有時間擴大，大量逆流使 LV 舒張壓在舒張期急速上升，LVEDP 可高達 40 mmHg 以上，接近主動脈舒張壓。": "The left ventricle has no time to dilate, so massive regurgitation makes LV diastolic pressure climb steeply through diastole; LVEDP can exceed 40 mmHg, approaching aortic diastolic pressure.",
 "左心房來不及擴大、順應性差，收縮期逆流使左心房壓急升：PCWP 出現巨大 v 波（可超過 50–60 mmHg），平均壓也明顯升高，常造成肺水腫。": "The left atrium has had no time to enlarge and is stiff, so systolic regurgitation makes left atrial pressure surge: PCWP shows a giant v wave (can exceed 50–60 mmHg) and the mean rises markedly, often causing pulmonary edema.",
 "常合併心房顫動，此時 a 波消失、cv 波更明顯。": "Atrial fibrillation often coexists; the a wave is then absent and the cv wave even more prominent.",
