 "心室收縮期": "Ventricular systole",
 "心搏過速是代償方式；心輸出量下降，常需緊急手術。": "Tachycardia is the compensation; cardiac output falls and urgent surgery is usually needed.",
 "快速節律示意": "Fast rhythm (schematic)",
 "急性重度 AR 時 LVEDP 可急升到接近主動脈舒張壓，脈壓反而不寬。": "In acute severe AR, LVEDP can rise abruptly toward aortic diastolic pressure, and the pulse pressure is not wide.",
 "急性重度 MR 的雜音常很輕甚至聽不到，大 v 波與肺水腫是重要線索；PA 壓可急性升高（常見約 50 mmHg）。": "The murmur of acute severe MR is often soft or absent; a large v wave and pulmonary edema are the clues. PA pressure can rise acutely (often about 50 mmHg).",
 "慢速 0.35×": "Slow 0.35×",
 "慢速播放": "Slow playback",
